00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:33.940
Well, if that's what Light says, then I'm going to support him no matter what.

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:40.020
I see. So if you were given the opportunity to work with Light on this investigation, would you take the offer?

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:41.260
What? Ryuzaki?

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:44.680
Yeah, I would. I'd do anything I could to help Light.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.940
Wait, hold on a second. Where are you going with this?

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:50.400
I'm planning to have Ivor pose as Geraldo Coyle again.

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:56.270
He'll tell the Yotsuba members that while he was investigating L, he discovered that Misa Amane might know who he is.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:59.970
He'll also tell them that L brought her in for questioning on suspicion that she was...

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:01.050
the second Kira.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.770
That part is true.

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:07.550
If the Yotsuba group believes that Misa could be their lead to finding Elle, then they'll

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:10.370
say that they want to meet her to discuss their advertising campaign.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.850
They'll use that opportunity to question her.

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:17.510
Thanks to lots of screw-up, they may already be considering Misa as their new spokesperson,

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:18.530
so this could work.

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:19.860
Yeah, right!

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.320
We can't do that.

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:23.950
This plan is too risky.

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:25.310
Who knows what could happen to you?

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.140
I won't mind doing something like this if it's for you, Light.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:35.580
Listen, Misa.

00:18:35.940 --> 00:18:38.500
If they suspect that you might know who Elle really is,

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:41.560
we don't know how far they'll be willing to go to get that information.

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.140
No problemo!

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:45.720
I promise I won't say anything, even if they torture me!

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:47.600
I can attest to that.

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:50.760
But Kidda can control his victim's actions before their death.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:55.140
There's a good chance he might try to manipulate her into revealing what she knows and then kill her.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:59.010
Also, if he does manage to kill Elle, he won't have any use for Misa.

00:18:59.130 --> 00:18:59.970
He'd kill her to keep her-

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:07.610
silent i don't like the sound of that light you forget that if we win against kira misa won't die

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:15.480
besides as long as we're handcuffed together you and i share the same fate if i die so will you

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:21.990
if that happens misa is the one who would grieve most of all either we lose and both die together

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:29.560
or we successfully catch kira which is it we never dream about living in a world without light yes

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:29.940
that would be

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.980
Cut it out! This is just crazy!

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:34.900
We're running out of time, and I'm starting to get desperate.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:42.000
As for Misa Amani, I've turned to her because I know her bravery and love for you is boundless.

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.050
Do you really mean it?

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:50.400
I've totally misunderstood you all this time! I even called you a pervert!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.500
But you actually do understand how I feel, don't you?

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:58.880
Yes. Misa is indisputably the most perfect and worthy woman for life.

00:19:59.120 --> 00:19:59.640
Yay!

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:03.130
Sweetie, thank you, Ryuzaki.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.940
Could actually fall for you.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:06.880
Let's not go that far.

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:09.360
But you could maybe be a friend of mine.

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:10.340
Would that be okay?

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:11.720
Yes.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:13.840
So now I've gained yet another friend.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:15.790
Yeah, of course.

00:20:16.050 --> 00:20:18.210
Any friend of lights is a friend of mine as well.

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:24.060
Yay, fun.

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:27.970
And of course, I would never think of betraying any of my friends.

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.970
With our powers combined, we'll already...

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:34.920
Unfortunately, Light's taking a different investigative approach from us,

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.940
and we'll be working with his father and the others.

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:39.320
I'm afraid it will just be you and I.

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:40.640
Huh? What's up?

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:43.190
Come on, Elle. Now you're just playing dirty.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:46.370
You're leaving me with no other choice but to join your...

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:47.410
No, that's quite all right.

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:50.310
What are you talking about? Of course he'll be joining us.

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:51.640
That's not it either.

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:54.280
I've been opposed to this investigation since the beginning.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.160
It's too dangerous for her.

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:58.500
Oh, Light. You're so sweet.

00:20:58.680 --> 00:20:59.960
Thank you for worrying about me.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:07.180
do this. I want to be useful to you somehow. If I can be useful, then maybe you'll love me even

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:14.040
more. And besides, I would gladly die if it were for you, Light. Figuring out the logistics of

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:19.300
arresting seven people is going to be challenging. I don't suppose you two have any ideas. Mogi,

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:20.360
Matsuda.

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:41.590
Well, I am an actress, director Nishinaka, Light, and the others, and now even Shinigami!

00:22:41.730 --> 00:22:44.610
They're all asking me to act! This is a lot of work!

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:48.310
I may land a commercial gig too! I'm so popular!
